WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Our episodes deal with serious and often distressing incidents. If you feel at any time you need support, please contact your local crisis centre. For suggested phone numbers for confidential support, please see the show notes for this episode on your app or on our website. Today's episode contains violence against children that won't be suitable for all listeners. The Corrunda Highway is a 172km long roadway that connects the South Australian Riverside Township of Murray Bridge with Lockston, further north, on the cusp of the state's border with Victoria.
我们的节目涉及严重且常常令人痛苦的事件。如果您在任何时候感到需要帮助，请联系您当地的危机中心。关于保密支持的建议电话号码，请查看您应用程序上或我们网站上的本集节目简介。今天的节目包含不适合所有听众的针对儿童的暴力内容。科伦达高速公路是一条长172公里的公路，连接南澳大利亚州河畔小镇墨累桥和更北边的洛克斯顿，该处靠近该州与维多利亚州的边界。

2
00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Largely desolate, the highway cuts through expensive agricultural landscapes with several remote houses and small towns dotted along the way, including Warnarka. Situated 105km east of the capital city of Adelaide, Warnarka's main street offers little but a post office, fire station and a public pay phone, plus a football oval and tennis courts nearby. With a population of fewer than 100 people, it's the kind of town where anything out of place is noticed. By mid-March 2015, roadworks along a stretch of the Corrunda Highway two kilometres east
这条公路大部分荒凉无人，穿过广阔的农业景观，沿途点缀着几栋偏僻的房屋和小镇，其中包括瓦纳卡。瓦纳卡距离首府阿德莱德以东105公里，其主街上几乎只有一家邮局、消防局和公共公用电话亭，附近还有一个椭圆形足球场和网球场。这里的人口不到100人，是一个任何不寻常的事情都会被注意到的城镇。到2015年3月中旬，科伦达高速公路位于瓦纳卡以东两公里路段的道路施工已经完工。

3
00:01:34.000 --> 00:02:15.000
of Warnarka were completed. Shortly afterwards, a large grey suitcase was sighted on the roadside. It appeared as though it had fallen off a passing truck. Unbleached, stained and dirty from having been exposed to the elements for an extended period of time, the Lanza brand suitcase caught the attention of multiple highway travellers, with one stopping to investigate. Upon partially emptying the bag behind a bush and realising it contained soiled children's clothing infested with insects, they disregarded the find and dragged the bag back to the roadside.
不久之后，路边出现了一个灰色的皮箱。它看起来像是从过往的卡车上掉落的。这个Lanza品牌的皮箱因长期暴露在恶劣天气中而变得未漂白、有污渍且肮脏，引起了多名公路旅行者的注意，其中一人停下来查看。当他们在灌木丛后半倒出包里的东西，发现里面装满了沾有粪便且虫子滋生的儿童衣物时，便不再理会这个发现，并将箱子拖回了路边。

4
00:02:15.000 --> 00:03:27.000
On Tuesday July 14, 2015, a motorist travelling down the highway pulled over to relieve himself. As he made his way into the thick bushland framing the side of the road, he noticed an array of dirty and torn children's clothing strewn under a patch of trees. In front was the abandoned suitcase. He crouched down to unzip the case and rummaged through its contents for himself, noticing a small human jawbone. The suitcase contained the heavily decomposed remains of a young child. National news outlets theorised that was missing Australian boy William Tyrell.
2015年7月14日星期二，一名行驶在该公路上的司机把车停在路边准备小便。当他走进路边茂密的灌木丛时，发现一丛树下散落着许多肮脏且破损的儿童衣物。最前方就是那个被遗弃的皮箱。他蹲下来拉开箱子的拉链，翻找着里面的东西，发现了一根小巧的人类下颌骨。皮箱里装着一具严重腐烂的幼儿遗骸。国家新闻媒体推测这正是失踪的澳大利亚男孩威廉·泰瑞尔。

5
00:03:27.000 --> 00:04:03.000
In September the year prior, three-year-old William was playing in the yard of his foster grandmother's house in New South Wales when he suddenly vanished. Ongoing search and investigative efforts had failed to turn up any trace of William, and although police had yet to conclude what had happened to him, the general consensus was the boy had been abducted. International media cast a wider net, suggesting the remains in the suitcase were those of missing English girl Madeline McCann. The three-year-old was at the centre of modern history's most reported-on missing person
在前一年的9月，三岁的威廉正在新南威尔士州寄养祖母家的院子里玩耍，突然神秘失踪。持续的搜寻和调查工作未能找到威廉的任何踪迹，尽管警方尚未对他的遭遇得出最终结论，但普遍的共识是这个男孩被绑架了。国际媒体将范围扩大，暗示皮箱中的遗骸属于失踪的英国女孩玛德琳·麦肯。这个三岁女孩是现代历史上被报道最多的失踪人口案件的中心人物

6
00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:44.000
case after she disappeared from her family's holiday apartment in Portugal in May 2007. All scenarios and suspects had been considered over the years, including the possibility she was abducted by a pedophile ring and transported overseas. Speculation ended at the conclusion of a post-mortem. The child was an unknown Caucasian female aged between two and four years old, approximately 90 centimetres tall with shoulder-length, fair-coloured hair. Two balls of blue and white striped dishcloth were tucked inside her mouth, which had been sealed with silver duct tape.
2007年5月，她在葡萄牙的度假公寓失踪。多年来，所有的假设和嫌疑人都被考虑过，包括她被恋童癖团伙绑架并运往海外的可能性。在一份尸检报告得出结论后，这些猜测终于平息。死者是一个身份不明的高加索女童，年龄在两到四岁之间，身高约90厘米，留着肩长的浅色头发。她的嘴里塞着两个蓝白相间的洗碗布球，并用银色胶带封住。

7
00:04:44.000 --> 00:05:24.000
There was no injury to the skeletal remains, and in the absence of soft tissue, a cause of death could not be determined, although asphyxiation was presumed. It was believed she had been deceased for upwards of seven years, killed elsewhere before her body was stored in the suitcase within a month, and discarded on the roadside where it remained until discovery. The girl's skull was covered with a disposable nappy, and a purple, down-underbrand bath towel was wrapped around the lower part of her torso. South Australia's Major Crime Investigation Branch established Task Force Mali to oversee
骨骼遗骸没有受伤的痕迹，由于缺乏软组织，死因无法确定，不过推测是窒息身亡。据信她已经死亡七年之久，在被运到别处杀害后，她的尸体在一个月内被装入皮箱，并被丢弃在路边，直到被发现一直留在那儿。女孩的头骨上盖着一块一次性尿布，下半身包裹着一条紫色的澳洲品牌浴巾。南澳大利亚州重大犯罪调查局成立了马利专案组来监督

8
00:05:24.000 --> 00:06:05.000
the case, fronted by Detective Superintendent Des Bray. He withheld details of the autopsy from the media, but told ABC News reporters that the child, quote, died of violent death under terrible circumstances. The media dubbed the unknown girl the Angel of Wanaka, and to the roadside where her remains were found was memorialised with flowers, teddy bears, and messages of grief. One read, You deserved better than this. Rest in peace, little angel.
该案由侦探总警司德斯·布雷负责。他向媒体隐瞒了尸检的细节，但告诉澳大利亚广播公司新闻记者，这个孩子“在可怕的情况下死于暴力”。媒体将这个身份不明的女孩称为“瓦纳卡的天使”，在她遗骸被发现的路边，人们摆放了鲜花、泰迪熊和悲痛的留言来纪念她。其中一条写着：“你本该得到更好的对待。安息吧，小天使。”

9
00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:48.000
Task Force Mali questioned every resident of Wanaka and learned of an incident in early May that had been a source of intrigue in the small town. One morning, when two Wanaka residents were walking their dogs outside town, they rounded the dusty track along the railway line and sighted a clean-cut man neatly dressed in a suit. He was Caucasian about 60 years old with grey hair and was of average height and build. The man was walking alone down the road with a large, dark-coloured suitcase. Without looking up, he crossed the train tracks into the scrub towards the Karunda Highway.
马利专案组盘问了瓦纳卡的所有居民，得知5月初发生了一起在小镇上引起好奇的事件。一天早晨，当两名瓦纳卡居民在镇外遛狗时，他们绕过铁路线旁尘土飞扬的小路，看到了一名穿着整洁西装的干净男子。他是一名高加索人，大约60岁，灰色头发，中等身高和体型。这名男子独自一人走在路上，提着一个黑色的大皮箱。他没有抬头，径直穿过铁路线，走向卡伦达高速公路方向的灌木丛。

10
00:06:48.000 --> 00:07:27.000
The dog walkers described feeling an unnerving sixth sense about the suited stranger. He was heading away from town and opted to carry his bulky suitcase as opposed to pulling it along by its handle. This sighting didn't align perfectly with the timeline established, as the first sightings of the suitcase on the roadside occurred in March, with the suited man witnessed more than a month later. Nevertheless, a connection was drawn and police appealed to the public to identify him. Images of the children's clothing found with the remains were released to the media, including
遛狗的人描述说，他们对这个穿西装的陌生人有一种令人不安的第六感。他正朝着远离小镇的方向走去，而且选择用手提着笨重的皮箱，而不是用拉杆拖着走。这起目击事件与已确定的时间线并不完全吻合，因为路边首次出现皮箱是在3月份，而穿西装的男子被目击则在一个多月之后。尽管如此，警方还是将两者联系起来，并呼吁公众协助辨认此人。媒体公布了随遗骸一起发现的儿童衣物的照片，包括

11
00:07:27.000 --> 00:08:09.000
a black dress with sequined tutu, a pink striped dress, silk boxer shorts, Dora the Explorer pajama pants, pink track pants, a cream fur-trimmed coat, and a single pink slipper with a butterfly motif on the toe. There was also a 90 by 90-centimeter patchwork quilt featuring a black border of colourful music notes. Although badly deteriorated, police were able to reconstruct seven of the quilt's 25 octagonal patches. They contained images of butterflies, geckos, dogs, a camel, a pumpkin patch, and stars.
一件带有亮片芭蕾短裙的黑色连衣裙、一条粉红色条纹连衣裙、丝绸平角短裤、爱探险的朵拉睡裤、粉红色运动裤、一件带奶油色毛皮边缘的外套，以及一只脚趾上有蝴蝶图案的粉红色拖鞋。还有一条90乘90厘米的拼布被子，边缘镶有彩色音符的黑边。虽然已经严重损坏，但警方还是成功重构了该被子25块八角形拼布中的7块。上面有蝴蝶、壁虎、狗、骆驼、南瓜地和星星的图案。

12
00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:47.000
The fabric had been manufactured in New York seven years earlier, but the quilt itself was handmade and machined stitched. Investigators believed the one-off item was crafted by someone close to the child, and may have been used as a teaching tool to help them identify the animals and objects on the patches. The black sequined tutu dress was one of 28 sold exclusively in store by fashion brand cotton on kids throughout South Australia eight years prior. As it was no longer feasible to trace the item back to the victim, investigators believed
这种织物七年前在纽约制造，但被子本身是手工制作并用机器缝制的。调查人员认为，这件独一无二的物品是由与孩子关系密切的人制作的，可能曾被用作教学工具，帮助他们识别拼布上的动物和物体。那件带有黑色亮片的芭蕾短裙是时尚品牌Cotton On Kids八年前在南澳大利亚州全境独家出售的28件服装之一。由于追踪该物品到受害者的可能性已经不大，调查人员认为

13
00:08:47.000 --> 00:09:26.000
the key to identifying the girl hinged on the one-of-a-kind quilt. Superintendent Des Bray told the media, "'Someone loved that little girl and either made her or gave her that quilt. I would appeal for whoever loved her to get in touch with us.'" Attempts to identify the child continued for weeks. Police extended their line of questioning to towns within a 250 square kilometer radius of Wanaka, as officers on horseback canvassed the terrain for 48 kilometers from the side of the discovery.
识别该女孩身份的关键取决于这条独一无二的被子。总警司德斯·布雷对媒体表示：“‘有人爱着那个小女孩，要么为她制作了这条被子，要么把这条被子送给了她。我呼吁所有爱她的人与我们联系。’”确认儿童身份的尝试持续了数周。警方将询问范围扩大到距离瓦纳卡250平方公里半径内的城镇，骑警们在发现地点周围48公里的地形中进行地毯式搜寻。

14
00:09:26.000 --> 00:10:06.000
Attempts provided dashcam footage taken along the Karunda Highway over previous years, revealing the suitcase had been moved and examined multiple times before it was finally reported to police. All 145 children from Australia's missing persons register had been ruled out, opening up the possibility that the victim's birth was unregistered, or that they were indeed from another country. Chief Inspector Greg Hutchins told the media he had never seen a murder like this in his 37 years of service, quote, "'This truly is a little girl lost.
搜寻工作提供了过去几年沿卡伦达高速公路拍摄的行车记录仪画面，显示皮箱在最终被举报给警方之前，曾被多次移动和检查。澳大利亚失踪人口登记册上的所有145名儿童已被排除，这引发了受害者出生未登记，或者他们确实来自另一个国家的可能性。高级督察格雷格·哈钦斯对媒体表示，在他37年的职业生涯中，从未见过这样的谋杀案，他说：“‘这真是一个迷失的小女孩。”

15
00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:44.000
She seems to be lost to society, lost to the system, forgotten by all. And that is incredibly sad.'" As the investigation reached its third month, Superintendent Des Bray announced, It's hard to believe someone hasn't missed her. I thought when we started this job that we would quickly identify who this little girl was. Somewhere out there is a mother, a father, at the very least an extended family, and I'm at a loss as to why someone hasn't reported this little girl.
她似乎被社会遗忘，被系统遗忘，被所有人遗忘。这真是令人难以置信的悲伤。’随着调查进入第三个月，总警司德斯·布雷宣布：“很难相信没有人会想念她。我以为当我们开始这项工作时，我们会很快确定这个小女孩是谁。在某个地方一定有一位母亲、一位父亲，至少还有一个大家庭，我实在想不通为什么没有人报告这个小女孩失踪。”

16
00:10:44.000 --> 00:11:26.000
On Tuesday, October 6, 2015, call number 1267 was placed to the crime stopper's hotline from a woman named Tanya Weber. Tanya lived over 1600 kilometres from Winarka, in the remote Northern Territory town of Alice Springs, and had been following the Angel of Winarka case. She recognised some of the child's clothing, but her concerns peaked when she saw the patchwork quilt, as it bore similarities to one that had been handcrafted by her best friend, Colleen Povey. Several photos of Colleen Povey's granddaughter, two-year-old Candelice Pierce, were supplied
2015年10月6日星期二，一名叫塔尼娅·韦伯的女子拨打了灭罪热线，电话编号为1267。塔尼娅住在距离瓦纳卡1600多公里远的北领地偏远小镇艾丽斯斯普林斯，一直在关注“瓦纳卡的天使”一案。她认出了孩子的一些衣物，但当她看到那条拼布被子时，心中的担忧达到了顶点，因为它与她的好朋友科琳·波维手工制作的一条被子有相似之处。科琳·波维的孙女、两岁的坎德利斯·皮尔斯的几张照片被提供给了

17
00:11:26.000 --> 00:12:04.000
to Task Force Malley. The toddler had pale blonde hair, and in one image she was wearing a pink striped dress similar to one found with the unidentified remains. The toddler showed Candelice in a stroller clutching a Rubik's cube. Tucked behind her was a patchwork quilt with a black border of colourful musical notes, an exact match to the one found with the Angel of Winarka. Tanya Weber explained that Candelice was taken into state seven years earlier by her then-20-year-old mother, Carly Pierce Stevenson.
马利专案组。这个幼儿有着淡金色的头发，在一张照片中，她穿着一件粉红色条纹连衣裙，类似于在未名遗骸旁发现的一件。照片显示坎德利斯坐在婴儿车里，手里拿着一个魔方。她身后藏着一条边缘带有彩色音符黑边的拼布被子，这与在“瓦纳卡的天使”身旁发现的那条完全吻合。塔尼娅·韦伯解释说，坎德利斯七年前被她当时20岁的母亲卡莉·皮尔斯·史蒂文森带入了州内。

18
00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:53.000
Take-named mouse for her short stature and petite features, Carly became pregnant at age 18 and gave birth to Candelice, known affectionately as Candles, on June 19, 2006. Carly took on motherhood seriously. She was fully supported and assisted by her family, however, a disagreement with her mother soon prompted Carly to seek independence and work elsewhere. In November 2008, Carly abruptly announced that she and Candelice were moving to Adelaide. She packed their belongings into her 1996 Holden Commodore station wagon and left. After a brief stop in the town of Port Augusta to visit Carly's grandmother, the pair continued
卡莉因为个子矮小和娇小的外貌而被昵称为“小老鼠”，她在18岁时怀孕，并于2006年6月19日生下了坎德利斯，小名亲切地叫作“蜡烛”。卡莉认真地承担起了母亲的责任。她得到了家人的全力支持和协助，然而，与母亲的一次争执很快促使卡莉寻求独立并到别处工作。2008年11月，卡莉突然宣布她和坎德利斯要搬到阿德莱德去。她把行李打包进自己的1996款霍顿准将旅行车，然后离开了。在皮里港小镇短暂停留以拜访卡莉的祖母后，两人继续

19
00:12:53.000 --> 00:13:36.000
onwards to Adelaide and spent a day at Marion Shopping Centre with an old friend. Shortly a week into their trip, Carly called family friend Tanya Weber in tears, saying she had made a mistake and wanted to come home. Tanya offered to pay for her flight or arranged to have someone pick her up, but Carly declined. By the end of their conversation, she seemed to have calmed down and was back to her happy self. Tanya tried contacting Carly numerous times after that, but she never answered. Over the coming months, family and friends progressively heard less from Carly and calls
前往阿德莱德，并与一位老朋友在马里昂购物中心度过了一天。旅行大约一周后，卡莉哭着打电话给家庭朋友塔尼娅·韦伯，说她犯了一个错误，想回家。塔尼娅提出为她支付机票费用或安排人接她，但卡莉拒绝了。在谈话结束时，她似乎已经平静下来，恢复了往日快乐的自己。此后，塔尼娅多次试图联系卡莉，但她从未接听。在接下来的几个月里，家人和朋友逐渐听不到卡莉的消息，电话

20
00:13:36.000 --> 00:14:13.000
stopped entirely after a year. Her Facebook page also appeared abandoned. On September 4, 2009, Colleen reported her daughter and granddaughter missing. Parents confirmed Carly was using her bank account regularly, with the most recent transaction occurring days earlier at an ATM in South Australia. Police made some phone calls and were informed that Carly was planning to move north to Queensland with a new boyfriend. Certain Carly and Candelise were fine.
在一年后彻底中断。她的脸书页面也荒废了。2009年9月4日，科琳报告她的女儿和孙女失踪。父母确认卡莉一直在定期使用她的银行账户，最近一次交易发生在几天前南澳大利亚州的一台自动取款机上。警方打了一些电话，被告知卡莉正计划带着新男友向北搬到昆士兰州。警方确信卡莉和坎德利斯安然无恙。

21
00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:58.000
The police nevertheless agreed to keep their file open until someone directly saw or spoke with the pair. According to reports, Colleen contacted the police again six days later, explaining she had received a phone call from Carly. Sounding strange and speaking in a whisper, Carly refused to disclose where she and Candelise were living, but reassured her mother that everything was fine. She also expressed a desire not to be contacted again. This report was disputed by Carly's family, who later stated it was the police who claimed
尽管如此，警方还是同意保持档案开放，直到有人直接看到或与两人交谈。据报道，科琳在六天后再次联系警方，解释说她接到了卡莉的电话。卡莉的声音听起来很奇怪，说话时压低了嗓门，拒绝透露她和坎德利斯住在哪里，但向母亲保证一切都很好。她还表达了不想再次被联系的愿望。这一报告遭到卡莉家人的反驳，他们后来表示，是警方声称

22
